.TH TIMINAL 1 "August 2026" "timinal 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
timinal \- render a configurable FIGlet clock
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B timinal
.RI [ OPTION ] ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B timinal
renders the current time using FIGlet's default font, or the font requested by
.BR --font .
Without
.BR --live ,
it writes one unpadded frame and exits. With
.BR --live ,
it refreshes a vertically centered clock until interrupted.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -L , " --live"
Refresh the clock interactively.
.TP
.BR -d , " --font-dir " DIRECTORY
FIGlet font directory, passed directly to
.BR figlet (1)
with its
.B -d
option.
.TP
.BR -f , " --font " FONT
Optional FIGlet font name or FLF file path, passed directly to
.BR figlet (1)
with its
.B -f
option.
.TP
.BI -F " FORMAT"
.br
.BI --format " FORMAT"
Use a Python
.BR strftime (3)
format. The literal two-character escape
.B \er
starts a new FIGlet block and is not printed. The default is
.BR %Y-%m-%d\er%H:%M:%S .
.TP
.B --uppercase
Display formatted text in uppercase.
.TP
.BR -l , " -c" , " -r"
or
.BR --left , " --center" , " --right"
Align text within the centered content frame. The default is
.BR --left .
.TP
.B --fixed
Measure printable ASCII glyphs once and render their full canvases in common,
centered fixed-width cells.
.TP
.BR -a , " --lolcat"
Color rendered frames through
.BR lolcat (1).
.TP
.BI -s " SEED"
.br
.BI --seed " SEED"
Set the lolcat seed. This applies only with
.BR --lolcat .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TIMINAL_LOLCAT_ARGS
Additional shell-style arguments for lolcat when
.B --lolcat
is used.
.SH KEYS
In live mode, press
.B Q
or
.B Escape
to exit. Control-C also exits cleanly.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success, including a user-requested live-clock exit.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid command-line option.
.TP
.B 3
FIGlet or the requested font is unavailable.
.TP
.B 4
.B --lolcat
was requested but lolcat is unavailable.
.TP
.B 5
lolcat failed.
.TP
.B 6
.B TIMINAL_LOLCAT_ARGS
is invalid.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
timinal
timinal --font standard
timinal --font-dir /path/to/figlet-fonts -f termino-tabular
timinal --font /path/to/termino-tabular.flf -F '%H:%M\er%d %b %Y'
timinal --live --font standard --format '%I:%M %p' --uppercase
TIMINAL_LOLCAT_ARGS='--freq 0.5' timinal --font standard --fixed --lolcat
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR figlet (1),
.BR lolcat (1),
.BR strftime (3)
.
